msgid "Empty: the company's default bank account."
msgstr "Leer: das Standard-Bankkonto der Firma."

msgid "Entry {reference} has no booking date."
msgstr "Buchung {reference} hat kein Buchungsdatum."

msgid "Every payment needs its own end-to-end ID."
msgstr "Jede Zahlung braucht eine eigene End-to-End-ID."

